  "description": "JUXWOQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C51 H119 Cl1 La6 O17. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.933-4.360 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.19-126.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La6(μ6-Cl)(μ3-OPri)2(μ-OPri)9(OPri)6].",
